    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gheeda Sulemani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani ghwadeas gheanyi aba gweanyeew damasamwagu, ak ghoahiit gheeda sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwadeas gheeda jeeda dareabeeta ng'eanyiida Lebanoni, geawundaanyi geegala geatin bughala, ea wiilooda geegala geatin was haradam ea damanamughuush, ea geawunda gal humng'eeda geegala geatin was diktam ea damanamughuush, nea geedeeksa uhuuda ghealooni samwagu bea daranajeega gubooyeeka ea darearjeeka gubooyeeka uhuuda daranajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geedukuteawa geediga gubooyeeka uhuuda jeeda geali mida iheenga daranaji haradam ea muut, gaba ghealooni eata damanamuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hean gwanda seawuut samwagu jeemba ghealoon samwagu, ea seawuutka galsiinyi sea suurja ghealoon samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghuusiga sean ea seawuutka sean gaba beehajeega meadaji uurdooschi ang'wan, ak gwanda seawadeeda wiilsiinyi sea nuut aba ghealoon samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwadeasa bugusta gheeda daranajeega; geawundaanyi geegala geatin haradam ea damanamughuush, ak wiiloadaanyi gaba geatin diktam ea damanamughuush, nea aba doodooda ghwadeasa daranajeega heeda sibatiisa geat, ea ng'udanga madeeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwadeas ghooriida jea gaba hoorgeeda gheambalmeeda; heeda jea eelacha girgweaguutka, eara ghooriida girgweageeda; hean geahiit aba geediga gidang'eada ng'eanyi ea gagul ng'udanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gheanyi jea goobiida, jeeda beashooda mida bwadaw bea doodooda, gawuurji gadiyeeda geatinga siida, gwadeeksa gheeda uurji nih hudeaba Farao was gatmoadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haleanjeeni seaniin geesina lagheanga mideawa sheayeeda haw, geesin gawuurji gidaghayi siiroorda, silaja musumeeno jih ea bwadaw, eara gidang'eada gumdooda ea gagul uhuuda ghamarda, ea gidang'eada ghooriida NG'UTAMIIDA ea ghwahita ghooriida haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gumdooda gheeda geesina lagheanga mideawa sheayeeda, lagheanga hees, lagheanga sigala geatin sis ea damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak uhuuda gheeda geayiin lagheanga mideawa sheayeeda, sibwaashaada gawuurji gidaghayi siiroorda, ea gubooyeeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea doodooda mida jeeda gheeda gwandeawa ghealoon samwagu bea lagheanga sibwaashaada aba meatkwajeega sean, ea ghealooniga daranajeega gubooyeeka; ak gwasunu eara ghooriida mida jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea doodooda gheeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gadiyeeda Huramu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goojeakta sugoocheanda was Sulemani eeyeana Huramu ng'eanyiida Diro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niny orjeeda masinung'weanda eemeeda fuga Naftali, nea ghwaan ea siida ng'eanyiida Diro, sina gadiyeeda gharinga, nea gwandeawa weaghuumeeda, ea fughareeda ea gearinda, aba sinooda gadiyeeda lagheanga oomng'i. Hean ghoan heeda sugoocheanda was Sulemani ak gwasissa gadiyoojigaaschi sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daranaji iyeenya bea gharinga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin daranaji iyeenya bea gharinga. Geatin damasis geegala geawunda daraneanagi, ea ghealooni bea geatin damaniyeenya neaweesa daranajeega, nea sheagi jih, nea hawundaanyi geegala moorin ang'wan, hean eara daraneedeaba iyeenya gawuurji nih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin ngoofaji iyeenya bea gharinga sighwarda, ak ghwayiin uhuuda daranajeega, geawunda ngoofajeanjagi geegala geatin muut, ak eara geawunda ngoofajeandeaba iyeenya geegala geatin muut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin nghear iyeenya bea gadiyeeda geatinga sighasa surumga heeda ngoofajeega mida iheenga daranajeega, nghearjeanda bea ngoofajeanjagi ea nghearjeanda bea ngoofajeanda niirja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin daranajeega; aba ghealoon iyeenya gwaneaweesa nghearjeanjagi; gwadukuta ngoofajeanda mida uhuuda daranajeanda; ak gwahindunu eara daraneedeaba iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa ngoofajeega mida iheenga daranajeega mida doodooda gaba deakghweeda eesh, bea geatin ang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ngoofajeega gwanda iheenga daranaji iyeenya ea iheenga geediga boolboolaneadi mida murdeeda nghearjeanda nea daranajeega ghwahita bughalaji iyeenya, nea gweata ghealoon iyeenya neaweesa; ak hean sea ngoofajeega suuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinda daranajeega aba jeeda doodooda gheeda sibatiisa ASEETA; ghamiinda daraneeda aba meatkweeda wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara ak gaguura gheawungaaschi Yakini, ng'ata ghamiinda daraneeda aba meatkweeda duukusa wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa ak gaguura gheawungaaschi Boasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iheenga daranajeega geesina deakghweeda eesh. Hean ghwahit gadiyeeda daranajeega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daangeeda lagheanga oomng'i",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin basooda sighwarda; nea buruk geatin damanamughuush gidang'eada meatkweenagi ea gagul meatkweeda niirja, ea geatin muut aba geawunda ea mareamarooda bea geatin diktam ea damanamughuush sigala neaweesiindaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea uuta gwanda ghadeatka, geatin diktam ea damanamughuush jea gwaneaweesa basooda; ghadeatka gweata ghealooni iyeenya, hean geejakta damanda sijakteawa suurja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghamiinaada aba badahuuka heew damaniyeenya, samwagu gang'ula wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa, samwagu gang'ula heeda biyeara, samwagu gang'ula wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara, ak samwagu gang'ula heeda ghayeawa; nea basooda geemiinda aba bugusta nyaawa, nea meatkwajeega nyaawa duukusa bwadaw geenung' gwaduukusa jih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea hawundaanyi gwadeena baneakta siida; nea gisheajeagaaschi geesinda gisheajeega gikoombe, gawuurji deakghweeda eashish; nea ghoamu ghoanyiit gikoombaji sagalamnyooji iyeenya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hoorgajeega lagheanga oomng'i",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikta gicha gwasin hoorgaji damanamughuush bea lagheanga oomng'i, nea giliwas hoorga geegala geatin ang'wan aba geawunda, ea geatin ang'wan aba wiilooda, ea geatin samwagu aba geawunda gal humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea deekshooda hoorgajeega gwasunu; gwandeawa beehajeega ak beehajeega geayiin jeeda ghamarda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea uhuuda beehajeega dageascheeda daranajeega miinaada gwanda ng'anyeeka ea heewga ea geeruubajeanda eara aba heetiyeada. Ak gwanda diyeadayda ea hing'eadayda ng'anyeeka ea heewga gwanda deakghweeda miyaasiin siimughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gicha gilinyoo ea hoorgeeda gil gaba nih mideawa geeshan ang'wan bea gharinga ea gharinga; ak aba majeekcheewi, meatkwaji ang'wan gwandeawa gharinga diiw daghwalda; ak geeshanga diiwiin geengoor aba musumaarajeega aba murdajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghuutaanyi gwanda ngoofajeanda gal humng'eeda bea geatinagi; ghuutaanyi ea boalboalanaat, gawuurji gisisinda uuta daraneeda, gaba geatinagi ea gidagween iyeenya iigal ng'eanyi. Nea ghuutaanyi gwanda haleanjeeda sisin; nea beehajeagaaschi gooyang'deay meadajeega sean, ak ea mii boalboalanaat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea geeshangiga asang'waniin gwanda hing'eadayda beehajeega; ak gharinga geeshanga gaba gharinyeanjagi sea hoorgajeega nea geawunda geeshta gaba geatinagi ea gilinuwaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea geeshangaaschi geesinda gea mutuku; nea gharingaaschi, nea gharinga ang'waay geeshanga, ea sidageenga nyaawa, ea gharingeaba jih gaba lagheanga oomng'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwandeawa daranajeega aba meatkwajeega sean asang'wan bea gilinyoo ea daranajeega gil nea daranajeega gaba gilagi sea geeshanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak nea uhuuda hoorgeeda gwanda neawaneeda was gharinyeanda nea geawundaanyi ea mwahita geatinda; ama ng'ata goobiida uhuuda hoorgeeda nea beehajeagaaschi gaba gilagi sea niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea usheaka hoorgajeagaaschi ea uhuuda beehajeagaaschi, gwasin geeruubajeanda, ea ng'anyeeka ea miilayga, gawuurji giteena dageascheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ng'ata gwasin hoorgaji damanamughuush; nea gawuurji sean, ak gooyang'deay nea geeratiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin biriikaji damanamughuush bea lagheanga oomng'i; biriikeenagi gaba nih eata gikoombaji haradam, nea giliwas biriika gaba geatin ang'wan, iisiiteen nea gaba biriikeeni mideawa hoorgajeega aba jeedeaba daranajeegiga atamanamughuushiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinda hoorgajeega. Muut aba meatkweeda duukusa wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeareewa gheeda, ea muut aba wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeaweewa gheeda; ng'ata ghwayiin basooda gujaka wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa bea gheeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rukunooda haleanjeeda jea eahiida gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasin Hiramu dahuundiga, ea mageemboojiga ea haragweaka. Hean ghoahit Hiramu gadiyoojiga sean ghayi sissa sugoocheanda was Sulemani aba gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "daranaji iyeenya, bwakuraji iyeenya mideawa ngoofajeega mida iheenga daranajeega, ea nghear iyeenya sineawsa bwakuraji iyeenya mida iheenga daranajeega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea bughalaji ang'wan bea goomamanga mideawa nghear iyeenya, ghealoon iyeenya bea goomamanga gilinyoo ea nghearjeanda, jea gwadukuta bakurajeega iyeenya mideawa ngoofajeega mida iheenga daranajeega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hoorgaji damanamughuush, ea biriikaji damanamughuush mida iheenga hoorgajeega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea basoanagi, ea heew damaniyeenya mida hing'eadayda basooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea dahuundiga, ea mageemboojiga, ea haragweaka, haleanjeeni sean bea jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDEAN ghayi sissa Huramu sugoocheanda was Sulemani, gaba gharinga oomng'i siitayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda mooheeda Yordani gwahista sugoocheanda hoowa, aba ng'eanyiida duw sheang'weeda bea bugusta ng'eanyiida Sukoti ea Saretani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Sulemani ghwanung'waada haleanjeeda sean ea meeyiita, aba gideaba aasaang'a muuchi; durumanata lagheanga oomng'i; ak ea meanala durumanata lagheanga oomng'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin Sulemani haleanjeeda sean mida jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA; heeda wagiida bea lagheanga mideawa sheayeeda haw, ea meesayda sisna lagheanga mideawa sheayeeda haw bea mukaateeyda giihiimnooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea hoorgajeega gheaboong'nyeanda dahaabu, nea muut gwanda wiilooda ng'eanyiida bea heeda biyeara ea muut aba wiilooda ng'eanyiida bea heeda ghayeawa, madeeda bugusta gheeda heeda ghaydit; ea deakghweeda, ea gheaboonyanga, ea beeleeshajeega dahaabu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gikoombajeega, ea makaasajeega, ea haragweaka, ea dabita siyiina haleanjeeda siing'andiita, ea rabagoojiga, bea dahaabooda miyaas; ea gharinga ang'oonyi gidaghuuta bea dahaabu, bea gidaghuudajeega jeeda gheeda was heeda ghaydit muuchi, ea gea gidaghuudajeega gheeda sibata ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 7:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh gadiyoojiga sean gil sin sugoocheanda was Sulemani gheata ahiit gadiyeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. Hean ghwaat Sulemani jeeda gheeda haleanjeeda ghayi badiischeesa ghwaan was Dawdi, lapiya, ea lagheanga mideawa sheayeeda, ea dabita, ak goodiiw aba jeeda ghooriida siitiiwiisa haleanjeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.7.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.7.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
